-- ============================================================
-- Warrior (Protection): Mocking Blow's cooldown moves so Incite can reduce it
-- ============================================================
-- Bug fix for woa_2026_08_09_09.sql.  Incite's -15/30/45 sec was not applying
-- in play.
--
-- The talent data was correct and is unchanged: ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER,
-- EffectMiscValue2 = 11 (SPELLMOD_COOLDOWN), base points -15001/-30001/-45001,
-- SpellClassMask 0x08000000, SpellFamilyName 4.  Verified against the built
-- Spell.dbc the server actually loads, not just the override table.
--
-- The problem is WHERE Mocking Blow keeps its cooldown.  It shipped with
--
--   Category             40
--   RecoveryTime          0
--   CategoryRecoveryTime  60000 (rank 1) / 120000 (ranks 2-7)
--
-- i.e. the entire cooldown is a CATEGORY cooldown.  Server-side that is
-- theoretically modifiable -- Player::AddSpellAndCategoryCooldowns applies
-- SPELLMOD_COOLDOWN to catrec as well as rec (Player.cpp:10983-10989), and
-- Mocking Blow does not carry SPELL_ATTR6_NO_CATEGORY_COOLDOWN_MODS -- but the
-- reduction never showed up on the client, which computes the cooldown sweep
-- itself and does not apply spell modifiers to category cooldowns.
--
-- Rather than fight that, the cooldown moves to the field every working
-- cooldown-reduction talent in the game already targets.  The prior art is
-- immediately to hand and is in this same tree: Shield Mastery reduces Shield
-- Block, which has RecoveryTime 60000 and Category 0, and it has always worked.
-- Improved Disciplines did the same for Shield Wall (RecoveryTime 300000).
-- Every one of them modifies `rec`, never `catrec`.
--
--   RecoveryTime          0 -> 60000 / 120000
--   CategoryRecoveryTime  60000 / 120000 -> 0
--
-- Category 40 is deliberately LEFT in place.  With catrec 0 it is inert --
-- AddSpellAndCategoryCooldowns only walks sSpellsByCategoryStore when catrec is
-- non-zero -- and category 40 contains nothing but the seven Mocking Blow
-- ranks, so nothing else shares it.  Keeping the field costs nothing and avoids
-- a gratuitous difference from retail.
--
-- The one behaviour genuinely lost: casting a low rank no longer puts the other
-- ranks on cooldown.  In practice a warrior only ever has the highest rank they
-- have learned on their bars, so this is unobservable.
--
-- Spells:
--   694 / 7400 / 7402 / 20559 / 20560 / 25266 / 47504 = Mocking Blow ranks 1-7
-- ============================================================

